## GET /api/stock/{ticker}/volatility/option-sentiment

Options Positioning Sentiment

Per-ticker options positioning sentiment (and recent history): VWKS (volume-weighted strike-spot
"center of volume mass") and AVAR (call vs put IV asymmetry), blended into a bullish/bearish score.
Positive = bullish positioning (volume above spot, calls bid up); negative = bearish.


